&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAssetsAndLiabilitiesIncurredFromTransactionsWithAffiliatedEntitiesTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingGuaranteeObligationsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;  ２ 偶発債務は、以下のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;銀行借入金等の保証&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:9pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:471.2pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:150.8pt;min-width:150.8pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:51pt;min-width:51pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:33.8pt;min-width:33.8pt;"/&gt;
